     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Reach Your Goal Safely and Efficiently </h1>",
      "body": "<p><strong>With the ZOLLER »redomatic«, shrink tools are quickly ready for use. The »pilot 4.0« image processing technology, the carrier system, and the continuous monitoring of the steps facilitate fast and reliable operation.</strong></p> <p>The »redomatic’s« technology ensures the shortest possible process times. Even inexperienced operator’s personnel can achieve this after just a short training period. All components have their fixed places on the carrier system. The »pilot« image processing technology »4.0« guides the operator through all steps and controls many processes fully automatically. For each step, the software specifies the component required and displays on the screen where the component is located on the carrier system. »redomatic« is the solution for adjusting, measuring, and shrinking tools to exact lengths.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "center",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
