  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »redomatic 600« MST </h3> <h2> Automated process for shrinking tools to 10 μm accuracy </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>With a »redomatic 600« MST from ZOLLER, you can use your MST tool holders optimally and thereby boost the efficiency of your production. </strong></p> <p>With »the« »redomatic 600« MST, you can be sure that tool lengths are always set correctly. The shrink-fit process developed by ZOLLER, using the »masterPiece« setting adapter, is both fast and simple. The perfect interplay between mechanical systems, pneumatics, electronics, and software, along with continuous parameter monitoring and automatic measurement sequences, guarantees you the highest level of process reliability.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/redomatic/Info-Pool/ZOLLER_Broschuere_redomaticMST_BRREDMST_00_DE.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Broschüre »redomatic&amp;nbsp;600«&amp;nbsp;MST\">»redomatic 600« MST Brochure</a></p>",
