    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p>»pilot 4.0« is the comprehensive software solution for all ZOLLER presetting and measuring machines. The intuitive graphic user guidance guides users quickly and safely to precise measurement results. This makes »pilot 4.0« so simple to use that even complex measuring tasks can be completed immediately. At the same time, the software offers such a wide range of functionality that there is a solution for every requirement. It is no coincidence that »pilot 4.0« applies as the unrivaled global standard for tool settings, measurement, and inspection.</p>",
